hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"472","Ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne humein khabar di, Abd al-Rahman ya'ni Ibn Salman ne mujhe khabar di, Amr jo al-Muttalib ke azaad karda ghulam hain, un se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne dekhne wale aur us shakhs par la'nat farmayi jis ki taraf dekha jaye."
